Journey: Mouse, keyboard and tricky DOM
Tags: @the-internet
Base URL: https://the-internet.herokuapp.com

Open /hovers
Hover over the 2nd "User Avatar" image
  Expect the page contains "name: user2"
Click the "View profile" link
  Expect the URL contains "/users/2"

Open /drag_and_drop
Drag #column-a to #column-b
  Expect the text of #column-a is "B"
  Expect the text of #column-b is "A"

Open /context_menu
Accept the next alert
Right-click #hot-spot
  Expect an alert saying "You selected a context menu"

Open /key_presses
Click #target
Press Tab
  Expect the page contains "You entered: TAB"
Press Escape in #target
  Expect the page contains "You entered: ESCAPE"

Open /shadowdom
Expect the 1st "Let's have some different text!" text is visible
Expect the page contains "In a list!"

Open /challenging_dom
Click the "edit" link in the row containing "Iuvaret4"
  Expect the URL contains "#edit"
Expect the "Apeirian9" cell is visible

Open /checkboxes
Check the 1st checkbox
Uncheck the 2nd checkbox
  Expect the 1st checkbox is checked
  Expect the 2nd checkbox is not checked

Open /dropdown
Select "Option 2" from the dropdown
  Expect the value of the dropdown is "2"
